{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1060d557c457f03a21bac21e116323ed7d381c6b84a5f25ead9b59b45e4f1430", "ja": "（今日は海美のソロライブ！　本人のやる気は充分\n……だけど、裏方で機材トラブルがあったようで……）", "zh": "（今天是海美的个人演唱会！她本人干劲十足……不过，后台似乎出了设备故障……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_1001_p", "source_sha256": "00466fe24f47eecc621b649223f1e52f9f70c3e1cd5a0acde6eec17f879c059f", "ja": "うーん、ライブの持ち時間、思ったより長く\nなりそうだな……海美、間をもたせられないか？", "zh": "嗯——演唱会的表演时间好像会比想象中更长……海美，你能不能想办法填补一下空档？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "3c1730326d4c3a6bad504e45d28679fdd6007b4361d5f5078ccbd1a96c261fdf", "ja": "ううっ、ムリかも……MC、全然思いつかないよ～！\nアドリブ……じゃ、ダメだよね！？", "zh": "呜呜，可能不行……MC环节的内容我完全想不到啦～！\n即兴……发挥的话，不行对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "7ccf56b886b45ff69806e918263f731b2a0b1be041129369472d0a0657273727", "ja": "うわーん、どうしよーっ！？　劇場の\nステージなら、みんなと一緒に話せるのにー！", "zh": "呜哇——该怎么办才好啊——！？要是在剧场的\n舞台上，就能和大家一起说了啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a61f5fd746dac665af6ab43f5b498049d6286496e8215345fcc9853cf489824c", "ja": "そうだよな、急な話だし……。\nわかった、仕方ないけど開場を遅らせよう。", "zh": "是啊，毕竟这事太突然了……。我明白了，虽然没办法，但还是把开场时间推迟吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "2b057c73f6adea14eecd32a39dca55f8f95fe01bb111a594ade3020e24d9610a", "ja": "えっ！？　待って待って！　それって、お客さんを\n待たせちゃうってことだよね？　それはダメだよ！", "zh": "诶！？等等等等！那不就意味着要让客人们等着吗？那可不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "43c9b9b19de48b09a61cc64500d05e91714f8a7aa64e091ceb60499092612355", "ja": "私、もっと頑張って考える！　考えるのは\n得意じゃないけど……私のライブだもん！", "zh": "我要更加努力地想！虽然想这种事不是我的强项……但这是我的演唱会嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "d999b73538e2c07f955f758f767cdb172319c3bf4763de459af569a9a2e16ad1", "ja": "えーっと、面白いMC、面白いMC……。\nむむ……むむむ……むむむむーっ！？", "zh": "那个，搞笑的MC、搞笑的MC……  \n唔唔……唔唔唔……唔唔唔唔——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fa1a37750d2c39329bc716a7671ad761286a74b09a0aa7e3adb6c35d6d4ecbff", "ja": "だ、大丈夫か？　うーん、煮詰まっちゃってるな……。\nよし！　海美、ここはひとつ……。", "zh": "没、没事吧？嗯……看来是卡住了……\n好！海美，这里就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_1009", "source_sha256": "f5dd68cec27c89b712f70f6fa71efbadb29f7c8bd93259a8b6c85c5c2d8cf505", "ja": "体を動かそう", "zh": "动起来吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_2000_p", "source_sha256": "3fa7ad0f00997070c52870d1d2b3c763e5230310ce267eda5bbe8c84f8975cb4", "ja": "体を動かしながら考えてみるのはどうだ？\nいい知恵が浮かぶかもしれないぞ！", "zh": "一边活动身体一边想想看怎么样？\n说不定能想到什么好主意呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_2001_029umi", "source_sha256": "17febb6faeae1c97a17f37fc3489113fffe4e899a1d9a6b44943ca4e0da7965b", "ja": "えっ！？　体を動かすのは大好きだけど……。\nそれでホントにいいのかな？　その方が思いつく？", "zh": "诶！？我虽然最喜欢活动身体了……  \n但这样真的好吗？这样就能想出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_2002_p", "source_sha256": "bca57ff566504129c885f8ae88eb939f075b7043c592a1215ca58519e6b2594f", "ja": "俺も煮詰まった時は、散歩に出たりするしな。\nじーっと考えてるよりは、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "我也是一陷入瓶颈，就会出去散散步。\n总比一直闷头苦想要好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_2003_029umi", "source_sha256": "c233966a8fcf067b1a7fa40b9f3da619a289cff592cd9831cc8d3ec47fae549d", "ja": "なるほどね、わかった！　よーし、動くぞーっ☆\nせーのっ……いーち、にーぃ、さーん……っ！", "zh": "原来如此，我明白了！好——动起来吧——☆\n预备……一、二、三……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_2004_p", "source_sha256": "9bd25b4421e4bfab43ebaec166e106dd0598f158bbe79dcd63bfbdb9f1799474", "ja": "（海美が、部屋の隅でスクワットを始めた。\nそして……）", "zh": "（海美在房间角落开始做深蹲。\n然后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_2005_029umi", "source_sha256": "5dfa270d305889f800168013ab1678ce8ac9a5d4a6b4b9c988828cf324d6af35", "ja": "はあっ、はあっ……や、やった！　出た！\n{$P$}、行ける、行けるよ！！", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……成、成功了！出来了！\n{$P$}，能行，能行的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_2006_029umi", "source_sha256": "2a4a8ed8c111d4f612ee29e8c10d7f2e946da4a97be08c97abc572b9acc2d911", "ja": "私がひとりでしゃべらなくても、これなら\nみんなと一緒に楽しめるし、絶対伝わるっ！！", "zh": "就算不用我一个人说话，这样的话\n大家也能一起开心，肯定能传达到！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_2007_p", "source_sha256": "e7f92f681b637ad4f908ad8994d3c177a196f6bf274dec776bdccc4b08708d36", "ja": "そうか、よかった！\nもうすぐ開場だな……任せたぞ、海美！", "zh": "这样啊，太好了！\n马上就要开场了……海美，交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_2009_029umi", "source_sha256": "648bb34874340a6a913b4e2764be0114ec42d312494fa02e9413b138bde6f640", "ja": "みんなー！　ライブ、楽しんでくれてる！？　\n次の曲に行く前に、みんなでちょっとゲームしようよ！", "zh": "大家——！演唱会，玩得开心吗！？\n在进入下一首歌之前，大家一起来玩个小游戏吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_2010_029umi", "source_sha256": "944541b910d8dbabf172002b90a0e3abe0c1a8eb631e2b2bd7d3b4904598f481", "ja": "名付けて……『海美と耐久スクワット』！\n私とスクワットして、最後までついてこれた人の勝ち！", "zh": "名字就叫……“和海美的耐力深蹲挑战”！\n和我一起做深蹲，能坚持跟到最后的人就算赢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_2011_029umi", "source_sha256": "fc8bb6a4f3085a28ce6a144b7c447089810571940bfc5eecb52a7973265b3491", "ja": "勝った人には、サイン入りTシャツをあげちゃうね！\n準備はいい？　それじゃあ……よーい、ドンッ☆", "zh": "获胜的人，我就送他一件签名T恤吧！\n准备好了吗？那么……预备，开始☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0274_2012_p", "source_sha256": "b1171d27af685410098ce7baa5973817fb6fe64fdf9fa4bae562b15d08c5506b", "ja": "（うん、凄く海美らしいステージになったぞ！\nかなり盛り上がったし……やったな、海美！）", "zh": "（嗯，真是非常有海美风格的舞台啊！气氛也相当热烈……干得漂亮，海美！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
